(7758414, 1284245, 61552, '<td valign="top">My experience with airplane and helicopter shots, is no more than 1/100 shutter speed, and with helicopters, maybe up to 1/125 when they''re on final approach (full power/RPM). The effect is the blurred propeller or rotor. It isn''t easy with a slow shutter, moving target, to get a shot as clear as this. Good photo!</td>', 'My experience with airplane and helicopter shots, is no more than 1/100 shutter speed, and with helicopters, maybe up to 1/125 when they''re on final approach (full power/RPM). The effect is the blurred propeller or rotor. It isn''t easy with a slow shutter, moving target, to get a shot as clear as this. Good photo!', '2023-10-03 13:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
